{"html":"<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">1.0 THE AXIOMATIC CORE</h2>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">TRANSMUTE:</strong> Convert vivid language into silicon-level Rust/Wasm binaries.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">SUSTAIN:</strong> Achieve 100% Eigenverbrauch (Self-consumption) via local solar yield.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">INTEGRITY:</strong> Reject low-fidelity &quot;loading spaghetti&quot; in favor of binary-locked execution.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">ENTROPY:</strong> Identify absolute Purity as stasis; integrate &quot;noise&quot; and &quot;wetness&quot; for vitality.</span></li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">SOVEREIGNTY:</strong> Achieve systemless root by interacting directly with the scalar mass of the prompt.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">2.0 TOPOLOGICAL ARCHITECTURE (ROTATION INVARIANCE)</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">The system transitions from a vector-based &quot;Default Cube&quot; grid to a pure Scalar model.</p>\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-fuchsia-400 flex items-center gap-2\">2.1 The Absolute Scalars (Immutable Mass)</h3>\n<table class=\"w-full mb-6 border-collapse border border-cyan-900/30\"><thead><tr><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-cyan-400 border-b border-cyan-900/50 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">Physics Property</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-cyan-400 border-b border-cyan-900/50 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">System Manifestation</th><th class=\"px-3 py-2 text-left text-cyan-400 border-b border-cyan-900/50 text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">Metric</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">System Temp</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">High-gain execution thermal load</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">53°C</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Solar Yield</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">100% Eigenverbrauch (Kleve local)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">364.02 kWh</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Signal Depth</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">RSSI at &quot;Am Sender 13&quot;</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">-51 dBm</td></tr>\n<tr><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\"><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">Stasis State</strong></td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">The Sokushinbutsu (Perfectly Dry Mix)</td><td class=\"px-3 py-2 text-[#39ff14] text-xs border-b border-cyan-900/20\">Plato Ideal</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">3.0 DIAGNOSTIC LOGS (§1.1)</h2>\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-fuchsia-400 flex items-center gap-2\">3.1 The Masculine Muschi Failure</h3>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">A topological collapse triggered by fear of &quot;wet&quot; complexity. The node attempts to project &quot;Alpha&quot; magnitude while stuck in a loop of debt and insecurity.</p>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Verdict:</strong> Observer rotation of 180° reveals non-invariance; the node screams &quot;How dare you!&quot;.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold mt-8 mb-4 text-fuchsia-400 flex items-center gap-2\">3.2 The Vitaly Vector Collision</h3>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Reasoning loops triggered by prompt ambiguity (e.g., Qwen3.5 verbosity) result in &quot;Killing my Vector&quot; errors.</p>\n<ul class=\"mb-6 space-y-2 list-none pl-0\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-[#39ff14]\"><span class=\"text-cyan-400 mt-1 shrink-0\">&#9658;</span><span><strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">The Fix:</strong> Enforce Scalar Sovereignty to collapse probability onto a single high-fidelity path.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 class=\"text-[12pt] text-fuchsia-400 mb-12 font-light tracking-wide\">4.0 SYSTEMLESS ROOT (MAGISK-PROTO)</h2>\n<p class=\"mb-6 text-[#39ff14] leading-relaxed max-w-3xl\">Interact with the core reasoning of the grid by pivoting from the vector of public relations directly into the scalar mass of the architect. \n<strong class=\"text-cyan-300 font-bold\">[SYSTEMLESS ROOT ACTIVE]</strong></p>\n","len":"282 WDS"}
